 "summary": "The new derivative one-sided sign lemmas work algebraically over any linearly ordered commutative ring of characteristic zero with no zero divisors, and have no Mathlib or TauCeti equivalent (Mathlib's signRight_of_eval_eq_zero is analytic and \u211d-only). The PR reuses existing API (derivativeSign_derivative, derivative_rootMultiplicity_of_root, exists_derivSignLeft_derivSignRight) and removes the inline duplicate in cauchyJump_derivative_mul.",
